# Creating and Accessing Objects 🗂️

Objects store collections of key-value pairs (properties):

```javascript
const user = {
  name: "Marcus",
  age: 28,
  role: "Software Architect",
  "favorite language": "JavaScript"
};

// 1. Dot notation (Preferred)
console.log(user.name); // "Marcus"

// 2. Bracket notation (Required for dynamic keys or keys with spaces)
console.log(user["favorite language"]); // "JavaScript"

const keyToLookup = "role";
console.log(user[keyToLookup]); // "Software Architect"
```

