# Array Destructuring 🪄

Unpack values from arrays into distinct variables in a single statement:

```javascript
const coordinates = [37.7749, -122.4194];

// Destructuring assignment
const [latitude, longitude] = coordinates;
console.log(`Latitude: ${latitude}, Longitude: ${longitude}`);

// Default values & skipping elements
const [first, , third = "Default"] = ["A", "B"];
console.log(first, third); // "A", "Default"

// Variable swap without temporary variable!
let x = 10, y = 20;
[x, y] = [y, x];
console.log(`Swapped: x=${x}, y=${y}`);
```

