# Object Destructuring 📦

Extract properties directly from objects into named variables:

```javascript
const settings = {
  theme: "dark",
  fontSize: 16,
  notifications: true
};

const { theme, fontSize } = settings;
console.log(`Theme: ${theme}, Size: ${fontSize}px`);

// Renaming variables and setting defaults
const { theme: activeTheme, language = "en" } = settings;
console.log(`Active Theme: ${activeTheme}, Lang: ${language}`);
```

