# Destructuring in Function Parameters 🎛️

Destructuring directly in function parameters creates self-documenting APIs:

```javascript
// Clean function signature
function renderUserProfile({ name, role = "User", isOnline = false }) {
  console.log(`User: ${name} (${role}) - Status: ${isOnline ? "🟢 Online" : "⚪ Offline"}`);
}

renderUserProfile({ name: "Elena", role: "Manager", isOnline: true });
renderUserProfile({ name: "Alex" });
```

